# Nissa, Leyline Tamer: "... Then if this is the first time this ability has resolved this turn ..." Dryad of the Ilysian
# Grove lets Bot1 play two lands in turn 5. The first Forest is that turn's first landfall: it draws a Forest and reveals
# the Forest and the Llanowar Elves under it, putting the Elves onto the battlefield and the Forest on the bottom. The
# second Forest is that turn's second landfall: it draws only, so the Llanowar Elves on top stays in Bot1's hand instead
# of arriving.

